                  CSO Audit Mode
                </span>
              </div>
              <p className="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
                Automated penetration testing engine scanning public endpoints for SQLi, XSS, DoS,
                and Auth Bypass.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button
            onClick={onClose}
